	<item>
		<title>[US] Kohl&#8217;s Early Black Friday LEGO Deals 2026: 40% off Selected LEGO (Over 30 Sets to Choose From)</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-kohls-early-black-friday-lego-deals-2026-40-off-selected-lego-over-30-sets-to-choose-from/</link>
