					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1230" height="554" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-Ad.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Kohl&#039;s US LEGO Early Black Friday Deals 2026 November Ad" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-Ad.jpg 1230w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-Ad-300x135.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-Ad-1024x461.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-Ad-768x346.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1230px) 100vw, 1230px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>Kohl&#8217;s US is currently offering their Early Access Black Friday Deals 2026. You can now save 40% off</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-kohls-early-black-friday-lego-deals-2026-40-off-selected-lego-over-30-sets-to-choose-from/">[US] Kohl&#8217;s Early Black Friday LEGO Deals 2026: 40% off Selected LEGO (Over 30 Sets to Choose From)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://howl.link/rz8xrgl0ck85x" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114253 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-Ad.jpg" alt="" width="1230" height="554" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-Ad.jpg 1230w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-Ad-300x135.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-Ad-1024x461.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-Ad-768x346.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1230px) 100vw, 1230px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/nig6x6lzl0x3u" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kohl&#8217;s US</a> is currently offering their Early Access Black Friday Deals 2026. You can now save 40% off on selected LEGO toys. In regards to the selection, there are <a href="https://howl.link/rz8xrgl0ck85x" target="_blank" rel="noopener">currently 36 LEGO sets you can choose from</a>!</p>
<p>You may be able to also earn $15 Kohl&#8217;s Cash for every $50 spend as well. Lastly, free shipping threshold has been lowered to only $25. So that means anything over $25 and you&#8217;ll get FREE Shipping.</p>
<p>Thanks to forum member <em>Marshallmario</em> for alerting us of the deal in <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3383-kohls-early-access-black-friday-deals-nov-6/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">our LEGO Sales USA Forum</a>.</p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/rz8xrgl0ck85x" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114252 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List.jpg" alt="" width="639" height="846" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List.jpg 639w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List-227x300.jpg 227w" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, 639px" /></a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p>We also have a<strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="608" height="486" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 608px) 100vw, 608px" /></p>
