					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75642-Showdown-with-Captain-Smoker-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO One Piece 75642 Showdown with Captain Smoker Summer August 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75642-Showdown-with-Captain-Smoker-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75642-Showdown-with-Captain-Smoker-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75642-Showdown-with-Captain-Smoker-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75642-Showdown-with-Captain-Smoker-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75642-Showdown-with-Captain-Smoker-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Good Thursday Evening Everyone! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/14-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-november-5-2026/">14 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for Tonight, November 5, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Thursday Evening Everyone! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-106647 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75642-Showdown-with-Captain-Smoker-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="880" height="828" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75642-Showdown-with-Captain-Smoker-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75642-Showdown-with-Captain-Smoker-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x282.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75642-Showdown-with-Captain-Smoker-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x963.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-One-Piece-75642-Showdown-with-Captain-Smoker-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x723.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 880px) 100vw, 880px" /></p>
<p>Our favorite deals include <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-ONE-PIECE-75642/dp/B0G2SYB9NS?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=4daed066b94f25e76abeba8b8400b3b6&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO ONE PIECE Showdown with Captain Smoker 75642</a> at 20% off for <strong>$55.99</strong> (reg.$69.99), <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-6585573-TBD-Creator-31392/dp/B0G2T3S9RN?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=ebf614854f4ea1acfa91535df4baefce&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Creator 3 in 1 Music Decor Piano with Cat 31392</a> at 15% off for <strong>$42.49</strong> (reg.$49.99) and <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-Speed-Champions-77264/dp/B0G2T46W65?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=02d176fd65ffe9e40f570ec7c7234a17&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Speed Champions Jaguar Project 7 &amp; Land Rover Defender 77264</a> at 20% off for <strong>$47.99</strong> (reg.$59.99).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-107588 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31392-Music-Decor-Piano-with-Cat-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="633" height="596" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31392-Music-Decor-Piano-with-Cat-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31392-Music-Decor-Piano-with-Cat-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x282.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31392-Music-Decor-Piano-with-Cat-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x963.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31392-Music-Decor-Piano-with-Cat-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x723.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 633px) 100vw, 633px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-107255 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77264-Jaguar-Project-7-Land-Rover-Defender-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="957" height="631" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77264-Jaguar-Project-7-Land-Rover-Defender-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77264-Jaguar-Project-7-Land-Rover-Defender-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x198.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77264-Jaguar-Project-7-Land-Rover-Defender-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x675.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77264-Jaguar-Project-7-Land-Rover-Defender-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x506.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 957px) 100vw, 957px" /></p>
<p>Below are 14 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 5, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>14 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 5, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-ONE-PIECE-75642/dp/B0G2SYB9NS?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=4daed066b94f25e76abeba8b8400b3b6&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO ONE PIECE Showdown with Captain Smoker 75642</a> <strong>$55.99</strong> (reg.$69.99)</li>
<li>15% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-6585612-TBD-Friends-42700/dp/B0G2SZXSXP?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=05314ce05d161b619d0b4445ed851595&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Friends Candy &amp; Cupcake Ferris Wheel 42700</a> <strong>$50.99</strong> (reg.$59.99)</li>
