					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="18+ LEGO Architecture 21065 Sagrada Família November 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Even though the brand-new 21065 Architecture Sagrada Familia LEGO set has only been released for a matter of</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/the-brand-new-architecture-sagrada-familia-november-2026-lego-set-is-already-sold-out/">The Brand-New Architecture Sagrada Familia November 2026 LEGO Set is Already Sold Out</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
