		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114198</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1377" height="886" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Front-Main-Entrance-Banner.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGOLAND California Front Main Entrance Banner" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Front-Main-Entrance-Banner.jpg 1377w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Front-Main-Entrance-Banner-300x193.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Front-Main-Entrance-Banner-1024x659.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Front-Main-Entrance-Banner-768x494.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1377px) 100vw, 1377px" /></p>
<p>November is here, and with it comes new deals from LEGOLAND theme parks (California &#124; Florida &#124; New</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/legoland-usa-november-2026-promos-deals-and-discount-tickets-california-florida-and-new-york/">LEGOLAND USA November 2026 Promos, Deals and Discount Tickets (California, Florida, and New York)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113574 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGOLAND-California-Annual-Pass-Banner-Ad-Logo.gif" alt="" width="1020" height="680" /></h3>
<p>November is here, and with it comes new deals from LEGOLAND theme parks (<a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York</a>) across the country. Read on to learn more about these deals and the many ways you can save on your next trip to the park.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-111279 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGOLAND-Florida-Lost-Kingdom-Adventure-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="1287" height="321" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGOLAND-Florida-Lost-Kingdom-Adventure-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo.jpg 1287w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGOLAND-Florida-Lost-Kingdom-Adventure-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo-300x75.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGOLAND-Florida-Lost-Kingdom-Adventure-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo-1024x255.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGOLAND-Florida-Lost-Kingdom-Adventure-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo-768x192.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1287px) 100vw, 1287px" /></p>
<h3>LEGOLAND California</h3>
<ul>
<li>Buy online and save, as tickets start at $69 per person when buying online compared to $139 at the front gate.</li>
<li>Anytime tickets start at $139 per person. No date needed, as this ticket provides admission to <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a> on any operating day in 2026.</li>
<li>Military members save on tickets, including 1-day LEGOLAND tickets and savings on Resort Hopper tickets, plus 2nd Day Free. Exact savings are based on gate price.</li>
<li>Annual passes start at $19 per month.</li>
<li>Kids tickets start at $39 per day with a hotel stay. Hotel stays start at $169 per person per night. Offer ends November 17th, 2026.</li>
<li>Book early and save up to 25% on your hotel, with prices starting at $144 per person per night.</li>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book LEGOLAND Hotel Stays at the Official LEGOLAND Site: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York</a></li>
</ul>
<p>These <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a> deals offer plenty of opportunities for families to save, between early booking savings and deeply discounted children’s tickets when paired with hotel stays. I also love the flexibility that the anytime tickets offer.</p>
<h3><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-111151 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGOLAND-Florida-LEGO-Ninjago-The-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="1412" height="361" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGOLAND-Florida-LEGO-Ninjago-The-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo.jpg 1412w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGOLAND-Florida-LEGO-Ninjago-The-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo-300x77.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGOLAND-Florida-LEGO-Ninjago-The-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo-1024x262.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGOLAND-Florida-LEGO-Ninjago-The-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo-768x196.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1412px) 100vw, 1412px" /><br />
LEGOLAND Florida</h3>
<ul>
<li>Enjoy an Ultimate Florida Ticket (which gains you access to 7 Florida attractions) starting from $114 per person, compared to $174 per person at the front gate.</li>
<li>From October 1st to November 30th, 2026, military and first responders get free entry to <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida</a>. The deal also offers a 50% discount on tickets for up to 6 guests who are visiting with the service member or first responder.</li>
<li>Kids&#8217; tickets start as low as $39 per day with a hotel stay. Hotel stays begin at $162 per person per night. Offer ends November 17th, 2026.</li>
<li>A deal for Florida and Georgia residents with hotel stays starting at $152 per person per night and kids&#8217; tickets from $39 per day. Offer ends November 17th, 2026.</li>
<li>Book 2 nights, get 1 free. Starting from $93 per person per night</li>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book LEGOLAND Hotel Stays at the Official LEGOLAND Site: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York</a></li>
</ul>
<p>This is a great month for any first responder or member of the military to visit <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida</a> and take advantage of the free entry and a much cheaper ticket for their guests.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114138 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Driving-School-Car-Ride-California-Florida-New-York-Theme-Park-Attraction-Christmas-Holiday.jpeg" alt="" width="800" height="534" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Driving-School-Car-Ride-California-Florida-New-York-Theme-Park-Attraction-Christmas-Holiday.jpeg 800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Driving-School-Car-Ride-California-Florida-New-York-Theme-Park-Attraction-Christmas-Holiday-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Driving-School-Car-Ride-California-Florida-New-York-Theme-Park-Attraction-Christmas-Holiday-768x513.jpeg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></p>
<h3>LEGOLAND New York</h3>
<ul>
<li>When you buy a 2027 pass to <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a>, you get the rest of 2026 for free. Starting at $99 per person.</li>
<li>Buy now and visit any time this season, starting at only $39 per person, compared to $99 per person at the front gate. These tickets must be used by January 2nd, 2027.</li>
<li>Kids&#8217; tickets start at $29 per day with a hotel stay. Hotel stays begin at $106 per person per night. Offer ends November 17th, 2026.</li>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book LEGOLAND Hotel Stays at the Official LEGOLAND Site: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York</a></li>
</ul>
<p>If you’ve been eyeing a 2027 pass to <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a>, now may be the time to consider it, as you’ll get to enjoy the park for the rest of 2026 for free with your purchase.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-112695 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGOLAND-New-York-Restaurant-Dining-Options.jpg" alt="" width="922" height="616" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGOLAND-New-York-Restaurant-Dining-Options.jpg 922w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGOLAND-New-York-Restaurant-Dining-Options-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGOLAND-New-York-Restaurant-Dining-Options-768x513.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 922px) 100vw, 922px" /></p>
<p><em>If you don&#8217;t want to stay at the LEGOLAND hotels, there are other hotels near LEGOLAND as well &#8211; <b>Book Other Hotels &amp; Vacation Rentals Outside of LEGOLAND: </b></em><a href="https://www.tkqlhce.com/click-5112601-15734399" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Hotels.com</a> | <a href="https://vrbo.stay22.com/toysnbricks/tbod3hLoQ8" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">VRBO</a></p>
<p><em><strong>Looking to get car rentals, flights or vacation packages to get to LEGOLAND?</strong> These reputable official travel sites allow you to purchase what you need:</em> <a href="https://expedia.com/affiliates/expedia-home.GpHMNqi" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Expedia</a> | <a href="https://booking.stay22.com/toysnbricks/CCGw6vqmUn" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Booking.com</a> | <a href="https://tripadvisor.stay22.com/toysnbricks/muM7xHVAH4" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">TripAdvisor</a></p>
<p><a href="https://expedia.com/affiliates/expedia-home.GpHMNqi" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109347 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Expedia-Travel-Banner-Logo-Leaderboard-728x90-Ad-3.jpg" alt="" width="907" height="108" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Expedia-Travel-Banner-Logo-Leaderboard-728x90-Ad-3.jpg 907w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Expedia-Travel-Banner-Logo-Leaderboard-728x90-Ad-3-300x36.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Expedia-Travel-Banner-Logo-Leaderboard-728x90-Ad-3-768x91.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 907px) 100vw, 907px" /></a></p>
<p><strong>With the official CityPASS, you can save big on bundled ticket attractions at Various Cities in US Including Boston, Chicago, San Francisco, Seattle and More):</strong> <a href="https://www.kqzyfj.com/click-5112601-11436795" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">CityPASS</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.kqzyfj.com/click-5112601-11436795" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109311 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/San-Francisco-CityPass-728x90-Banner-Logo-Ad-USA.png" alt="" width="728" height="90" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/San-Francisco-CityPass-728x90-Banner-Logo-Ad-USA.png 728w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/San-Francisco-CityPass-728x90-Banner-Logo-Ad-USA-300x37.png 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 728px) 100vw, 728px" /></a></p>
<p>Below are other quick links for LEGOLAND Theme Parks Resorts.</p>
<h3>Official Discount Landing Pages for Worldwide LEGOLAND Theme Parks</h3>
<p><strong>For the most up to date current LEGOLAND Theme Parks sales &amp; deals, check the official LEGOLAND Theme Parks promotional pages links below. </strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>California, US</strong> &#8211; LEGOLAND Theme Park Sales &amp; Deals Promotional Page</a></li>
