					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1297" height="829" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60445-Formula-1-F1-Truck-with-RB20-AMR24-F1-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO City 60445 Formula 1 F1 Truck with RB20 &amp; AMR24 F1 Cars January 2025 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60445-Formula-1-F1-Truck-with-RB20-AMR24-F1-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 1297w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60445-Formula-1-F1-Truck-with-RB20-AMR24-F1-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x192.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60445-Formula-1-F1-Truck-with-RB20-AMR24-F1-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x655.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60445-Formula-1-F1-Truck-with-RB20-AMR24-F1-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x491.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1297px) 100vw, 1297px" /></p>
<p>Good Afternoon LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for this afternoon. Free shipping on orders</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/6-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-afternoon-november-4-2026/">6 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 4, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
