										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Afternoon LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for this afternoon. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p>Below are 6 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 4, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don&#8217;t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>6 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 4, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-City-Truck-RB20-AMR24/dp/B0DJ1C21C6?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=4d74d719f397004dfb8edaa23ecb0da2&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City F1 Truck with RB20 &amp; AMR24 F1 Car 60445</a> <strong>$80</strong> (reg.$99.99)</li>
<li>13% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-A-2026-72152/dp/B0FMYVG58P?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=3f3a81afe2f32ea275af986e305f52f1&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Pokémon Pikachu and Poké Ball 72152</a> <strong>$174.98</strong> (reg.$199.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103947 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72152-Pikachu-and-Poke-Ball-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="857" height="841" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72152-Pikachu-and-Poke-Ball-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 857w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72152-Pikachu-and-Poke-Ball-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x294.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72152-Pikachu-and-Poke-Ball-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x754.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 857px) 100vw, 857px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103948 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72152-Pikachu-and-Poke-Ball-February-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="682" height="877" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72152-Pikachu-and-Poke-Ball-February-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 682w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72152-Pikachu-and-Poke-Ball-February-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-233x300.jpg 233w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 682px) 100vw, 682px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92571 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60445-Formula-1-F1-Truck-with-RB20-AMR24-F1-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="1297" height="829" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60445-Formula-1-F1-Truck-with-RB20-AMR24-F1-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 1297w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60445-Formula-1-F1-Truck-with-RB20-AMR24-F1-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x192.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60445-Formula-1-F1-Truck-with-RB20-AMR24-F1-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x655.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-City-60445-Formula-1-F1-Truck-with-RB20-AMR24-F1-Cars-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x491.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1297px) 100vw, 1297px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Coast-Guard-Helicopter-Building/dp/B0FMS95TFF?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=2971eb1d0a378c720c359fe86da3ecd0&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City Coast Guard Helicopter 60503</a> <strong>$51.99</strong> (reg.$64.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-Star-Wars-75444/dp/B0FMYWLLNJ?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=dc37d065c44393af00b96421937fd01b&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars AT-RT Attack 75444</a> <strong>$35.96</strong> (reg.$44.99)</li>
</ul>
