		<title>LEGO Venetian Neighborhood and Dragon Ball: Shenron &#038; Goku Sets Now Officially Released to General Public (Free GWP Gift with Purchase Promo)</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-venetian-neighborhood-and-dragon-ball-shenron-goku-sets-now-officially-released-to-general-public-free-gwp-gift-with-purchase-promo/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-venetian-neighborhood-and-dragon-ball-shenron-goku-sets-now-officially-released-to-general-public-free-gwp-gift-with-purchase-promo/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 04:20:55 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[18+/Hard to Find Theme]]></category>
