<h2><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Two LEGO IDEAS Godzilla Sets &amp; GWP November 2026 Black Friday Revealed</span></h2>
<h3>21375 Godzilla November 2026 Black Friday: Release Dates, US/Canada Prices &amp; Set Images Info</h3>
<ul>
<li>Retail Price: $449.99 USD / $629.99 CAD / £349.99 GBP / $649.99 AUD</li>
<li>Recommended Age: 18+</li>
<li>Number of Pieces: 5363</li>
<li>Official Release Date: November 27, 2026 (Black Friday)</li>
